.TH IDLE-APPLET 1 "July 2026" "IdleScreen" "IdleScreen COSMIC Applet"
.SH NAME
idlescreen-applet \- COSMIC panel applet for managing the IdleScreen (idle) screensaver daemon
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B idlescreen-applet
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B idlescreen-applet
is the System76 COSMIC Desktop panel applet for IdleScreen (package name
.BR idle ).
It runs as part of cosmic-panel and displays status in the tray, allowing users
to toggle the daemon user service, idle activation, timeout, render scale, FPS
overlay, select plugins, and preview savers.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR idle-daemon (1),
.BR idle-cli (1),
.BR idle-tui (1)
